<%# A relation of THIS ticket was created or removed: its section and its waiting hint, its
    list row (table and phone) and its board card, the flash, and after a create the modal
    instance that sent it removed (its controller then drops the frame's src and returns the
    focus). Only that instance: a modal opened again meanwhile stays (review of #944). Nothing
    for the other ticket (plan §4, review 5): no stream for its section, hint, row or card,
    whose markup would carry its title.

    The row takes the reader's base view: no form here carries the active folder, the same
    limit as a comment's row (PostsController). The card is the open ticket's, so it is marked
    as selected from the first paint. On a page without a list or a board they have no target. %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace ticket_relations_section_id(@ticket),
                         partial: 'organisations/tickets/relations_section', locals: { ticket: @ticket } %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace ticket_waiting_hint_id(@ticket),
                         partial: 'organisations/tickets/waiting_hint', locals: { ticket: @ticket } %>
<%= safe_join(ticket_list_row_streams(@ticket, columns: @list_columns)) %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace "kanban-card-#{@ticket.id}",
                         partial: 'organisations/tickets/kanban_card',
                         locals: { ticket: @ticket, project: @project, organisation: current_organisation, selected: true } %>
<% if @modal_token %>
  <%= turbo_stream.remove ticket_relation_modal_instance_id(@ticket, @modal_token) %>
<% end %>
<%= turbo_stream.prepend 'flash', partial: 'layouts/flash', locals: { flash: @flash_message } %>
